The table below shows the required or supported versions of the software
necessary to operate the charm.

| Software   | Required version |
|------------|------------------|
| Juju       | {{ juju_version }} |
| Kubernetes | {{ kubernetes_version }} |
| Ubuntu     | {{ ubuntu_version }} |
{% if ns.brk %}
